Source: limpet-agent
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Lumen Industries <packaging@lumen.local>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: limpet-agent
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), tmux
Description: Limpet agent core launcher and first-boot LLM wizard
 Ships `limpet-agent.service`, which creates (or re-attaches) the
 "limpet-executor" tmux session the agent core runs in, and
 `limpet-llm-firstboot.service`, a one-shot console wizard that asks an
 operator for an LLM provider (cloud API key, local Ollama, or none) on first
 boot and writes the answer to `/etc/limpet/llm.toml`.
